ABangle installation.

ABangle has been developed to run from command line of a linux os 

Dependencies:
	Python 3
	numpy python module (http://numpy.scipy.org/)
	Biopython (https://biopython.org/)
	anarci
	fastcore
	pip

	Required for visualisation:
		R and Rscript (http://www.r-project.org/)
		PyMOL  (http://www.pymol.org/) 
		display (Included in open source ImageMagick package: http://www.imagemagick.org/ ) 

	Required for testing (development only):
		pytest

To install:
	~ Create the Conda environment:
		conda env create -f environment.yml
	~ Activate it:
		conda activate abangle
	~ Install the local package with pip:
		python -m pip install -e .

To run on command line:
	ABangle

For more infomation see README

Any issues please contact james.dunbar@dtc.ox.ac.uk	
